{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:56:37+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:56:37+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Cox Infrastructure Group, S.A.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Renewable","country":"Spain","city":"Seville","website":"https://grupocox.com","employees":10530,"summary":"Cox Infrastructure Group, S.A. operates an utilities company in South America, Mexico, Europe, Africa, Spain, Latin America, and internationally. It engages in the desalination, purification, reutilization, treatment, and integrated water resource management business. The company also generates and transmits renewable energy, such as photovoltaics, solar thermal, and biofuels. Cox ABG Group, S.A. offers engineering, procurement, operations, and maintenance services. The company was formerly known as Cox ABG Group, S.A. and changed its name to Cox Infrastructure Group, S.A. in June 2026. Cox Infrastructure Group, S.A. was founded in 2014 and is headquartered in Seville, Spain. Cox Infrastructure Group, S.A. operates as a subsidiary of Inversiones Riquelme Vives, S.L.","exchange":"MCE","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Cox Infrastructure Group, S.A. exploite une société de services publics en Amérique du Sud, au Mexique, en Europe, en Afrique, en Espagne, en Amérique latine et à l'international. Il s'occupe du dessalement, de la purification, de la réutilisation, du traitement et de la gestion intégrée des ressources en eau. La société génère et transmet également des énergies renouvelables, telles que le photovoltaïque, le solaire thermique et les biocarburants."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":916143872,"shares_outstanding":84828137,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":6.2427745,"price_to_book":4.591837,"ev_to_ebitda":21.164,"ev_to_revenue":3.102,"dividend_yield":0.0,"payout_ratio":0.0,"beta_yahoo":null},"targets":{"current_price":10.8,"mean